### 5. Missing Security Headers (OWASP A05 – Security Misconfiguration)
Express by default sends an `X-Powered-By: Express` header (fingerprinting) and lacks important security headers like `Content-Security-Policy`, `X-Frame-Options`, etc.

**Recommendation:** Use `helmet`.

```js
