### 10. No Security Logging or Audit Trail (OWASP A09 – Security Logging & Monitoring Failures)

**Risk:** The app logs only a startup message. There is no access logging, no authentication event logging, and no alerting. Attackers could probe the system indefinitely without detection.

**Recommendation:**
```js
const morgan = require('morgan'); // npm install morgan

// Structured access logging (use 'combined' format for production)
app.use(morgan('combined'));

