## Finding 6 — 🟡 MEDIUM | No CORS Policy (OWASP A05)

**Location:** Application bootstrap

With no CORS configuration, Express defaults to the browser's same-origin policy — fine now, but any future `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` shortcut (common under deadline pressure) will allow any website to make credentialed requests on behalf of your users.

**Recommendation:** Lock down CORS explicitly from the start:

```bash
npm install cors
```

```js
// ✅ RECOMMENDED
