## 🔐 Security Review: `app.js`

> **Context:** Express.js application with two routes (`/health`, `/users`). No `package.json` or other files were found, so this review focuses on the code as written and flags missing security infrastructure.

---

### 🚨 Findings Summary

| # | Severity | Category | Issue |
|---|----------|----------|-------|
| 1 | 🔴 Critical | Authentication | No authentication or authorization on any route |
| 2 | 🔴 Critical | Sensitive Data Exposure | PII (emails) served without access control |
| 3 | 🟠 High | Security Headers | No security headers (OWASP A05) |
