.env
.env.*
!.env.example     # allow only the template with no real values
```

Use a secrets manager (AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault, etc.) or a CI/CD secret store instead of flat files. Provide a `.env.example` with placeholder values only:

```bash
